{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e09d96976b5564f9f2e1a5f41916e48682eaf28516c8356bf863d837953fb131", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nお忙しいところ申し訳ないんですが……。", "zh": "青羽小姐，您辛苦了。\n不好意思，在您忙的时候打扰您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "7d5129046907b28208f91c8d4550046fbd993faa7a1004bb9d0d7655282a126a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c1b669c9147d18e90eee389c337ad72a1f7add086825ff2b3d095171f93a0a62", "ja": "定期公演の衣装発注がそろそろで……でも他の公演も\nありますし、スケジュール調整しようかと。", "zh": "定期公演的服装差不多该下单了……不过还有其他公演，\n我在想是不是要调整一下日程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "bd696cc33a958333803d2f0f319498e2d25f862bf4c638916c067daf0763b230", "ja": "あっ、そうですね。定期公演もあるんだった……\nでも大丈夫です！　スケジュールは、いつも通りで！", "zh": "啊，对了。还有定期公演来着……\n不过没关系！日程就照平时安排吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "67c0717e2c5b402955824b21157aaf26f24c6c934532c4c9917efad4d4fb466a", "ja": "えっ……平気ですか？　青羽さんのタスク、\nかなり積まれてると思うんですけど……。", "zh": "诶……真的没问题吗？我觉得青羽小姐的任务已经堆得相当多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "2ea1215d8d97d714bb207becc825402b98c9883651adc6df303db900a3e5e760", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です！　それより、\n{$P$}さんに伝言があって……。", "zh": "好的，没问题！先不说这个，我有句话要转告给{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "5b021d49f2264b20f4461ec334c1662ba084096a5522de716329a6d5d87cf97a", "ja": "社長さんから、\n今すぐ事務所に来てほしいって！", "zh": "社长说，\n让您现在马上来事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "825a235cba01f6b60ced41a3e0bd1b63479ad9359c1c04b45e5d66dd7c173e79", "ja": "い、今すぐですか？\nそういう指定は珍しいですね……。", "zh": "现、现在立刻吗？\n这种要求还真少见呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "47b633188dba49c07b3e51936c457c87b36e90d954f9825a3d2c240478e76764", "ja": "ですよね。私は大丈夫なので、\n{$P$}さんは事務所へどうぞ！", "zh": "就是说吧。我没关系的，{$P$}先生请去事务所吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "0cd315642fe94b156198c7f7aba6accd24fda5a5df01342236fd97b8823d913d", "ja": "音無先輩に聞いたんですけど……\nどうやら、届いたみたいなんです。", "zh": "我听音无前辈说了……好像已经送到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "23b955cd9123b8c08fdfbc49d1fc60d5142842d71e94fe5719bcd1f1328b1bf0", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』第九幕の決定稿……！", "zh": "《STARDOM ROAD》第九幕的定稿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "89d4e0e0a1c652fcd5d26900d3386a49e398556a4491850891866acba1f48601", "ja": "！　なるほど、わかりました！\nそれは確かに今すぐ……ですね！", "zh": "！原来如此，我明白了！\n确实得马上……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "88688be8744e427dc857b746ea2befdf1f27f0fee54e26bc920ef5c36ac18306", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n行ってきます！", "zh": "非常感谢！\n我这就出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "1a475e056ee8f118f4de57b02e19806ce389d29ad020c7bbcfc62a7553b10751", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃ～い！\n……私も、エンジン全開でいかなくちゃ！", "zh": "好的，路上小心～！\n……我也得全力以赴才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f1efd5783e4d00d550ac99e97e7caa92959cfbe56588c7e8a5c24197df0536e0", "ja": "やあ、よく来てくれたね君！\nもう聞いているとは思うが……。", "zh": "嗨，欢迎你来！\n我想你应该已经听说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "17a5e55b92da2f81bb1fcd4721d1a63724c242eb46b9617d5335f3efb8879770", "ja": "はい！　『STARDOM ROAD』第九幕の\n決定稿が上がったとか。", "zh": "是的！听说《STARDOM ROAD》第九幕的定稿已经出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "243d764e4335baa778f02c0e9b57644b1e9b031c5452cd2918ae88c42e8f2456", "ja": "第七幕からは驚きの連続でしたけど、\n第八幕の最後は衝撃でしたからね……。", "zh": "从第七幕开始就是接连不断的惊喜，不过第八幕的结尾实在太震撼了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "675c9c329111c83cccfa75d9e9aa7f7325e048759fb5a551870c120d0affbca3", "ja": "まさか、真珠星ちゃんのお姉ちゃん、\n織姫ちゃんが生きていたなんて……。", "zh": "没想到，真珠星的姐姐织姬竟然还活着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8517d3bcbd72d5778cbac1e5ae4acb7a9d47075d66e3b621ba0c954d720f7dae", "ja": "はい。もしかすると、勘の鋭い人達には、\nこの展開が読めていたのかもしれませんが……。", "zh": "是的。或许对于直觉敏锐的人来说，早就猜到会这样发展了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a9bc1fc19db89740ceca5ee073a6fb092d668dbfe724f8a2269b466743e371ca", "ja": "今回、彼女の思惑や真意と主人公の真珠星が\n向き合い……そして、ひとつの決着を迎えます。", "zh": "这一次，她的打算与真意将和主角的珍珠星正面交锋……并迎来一个了结。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "3739621a1d902844f28e2fe1624a618c6bd9c57f67e5a2383f0249dc16f78867", "ja": "気になる……！　でも、{$P$}さん\nより先には読んでませんからね！？", "zh": "好在意……！不过，我可没有读到{$P$}先生之后哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "189cda37395cedde6e3f0dbf2869760471e3eb8341960a0539ee9ad564bc3f99", "ja": "はっはっは、無理もない。劇場の39人で\n繋げてきた超ロングラン公演の決着だ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，这也难怪。由剧场的39人一路接力延续至今的超长期公演，终于要迎来结局了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "d5de787bba30e2673e30f6ec15bdcf7688d21e83d1207bccaa99495ac20e94d1", "ja": "アイドル諸君が走り抜いてたどり着いた\n『STARDOM ROAD』最終幕……。", "zh": "偶像们一路奔跑抵达的《STARDOM ROAD》最终幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "baaaffa7d96b9b7b39422f380e664176b39d3f2f583ecaa404259b3c8e0252da", "ja": "無論、今回も君の力が不可欠だ。\nどうか大いに盛り上げてほしい！", "zh": "当然，这次也少不了你的力量。请务必把气氛炒热！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "453904a75f06266c63746bb39074841c2888b285bd9a3130374ab70b71e1d0bc", "ja": "承知しています！　今回ステージに立つのは\n5人でも、39人の気持ちが乗っていますから！", "zh": "我明白！这次登上舞台的虽然只有5人，但承载着39人的心意呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "850767d01a1c36ba7c9929438c65612de305280ef28fd18c6800df973a1d8e58", "ja": "頼もしい限りだ。\n盛大なフィナーレを、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "真是可靠。盛大的终场演出，就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
